1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:02,921
You send money for something that matters.

2
00:00:02,941 --> 00:00:05,705
It gets spent on something else.

3
00:00:06,185 --> 00:00:11,270
Earmark locks money to one item, at one store, for one person.

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,620
Gifts that become what you meant.

5
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,360
Donations that buy exactly what a shelter needs.

6
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,939
Groceries for family.

7
00:00:17,959 --> 00:00:20,211
Budgets for your team.

8
00:00:20,491 --> 00:00:23,153
Type who it's for and what it should buy.

9
00:00:23,173 --> 00:00:24,871
Lock it with Face ID.

10
00:00:24,891 --> 00:00:26,508
It can only be spent on that,

11
00:00:26,528 --> 00:00:29,152
and the change goes to them.

12
00:00:31,032 --> 00:00:33,264
For stores, it's one button at checkout

13
00:00:33,284 --> 00:00:35,157
and a signer on the server.

14
00:00:35,177 --> 00:00:38,024
Get paid instantly, at your real price,

15
00:00:38,044 --> 00:00:41,411
only for the item the money was meant for.

16
00:00:41,892 --> 00:00:44,252
Every gift has its own fingerprint.

17
00:00:44,272 --> 00:00:46,516
Earmark even calls to remind you.

18
00:00:46,536 --> 00:00:49,996
And if it's never used, the money goes back.

19
00:00:50,476 --> 00:00:53,239
Earmark. Money with a purpose.
